Pure bracket.ts infers the tournament from synced round labels: rounds in
play order, two-legged pairings folded into one tie with an aggregate,
winners inferred (level ties stay honestly undecided), and feeder links
tracing each tie back to the round that produced it. The Cups page renders
ties with aggregate headers and winner/feeder edges instead of flat
per-round fixture lists; live matches still surface once at the top.

